    "title": "Roseville Woman Charged After Biting, Knife Attack She Says Was Fueled by Possession Fear - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Zach White ,\n14 hours ago\nA Roseville woman is facing a felony assault charge after police say she bit a sleeping woman and then returned to the bedroom with two knives, slashing the victim across the forehead and chin. Moran Guan told officers afterward that she believed the victim was possessed and feared she would die if she did not attack her, according to a criminal complaint filed October 22.\nRead full article",
